<title>USA: Arizona Public Service files $125 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>Arizona Public Service files $125 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arizona Public Service Co filed Wednesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $125 million in first mortgage bonds, senior notes and debt securities.</p>
<p>The Phoenix-based company said its shelf offering totals $150 million when added with previously registered debt.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used primarily to repay outstanding debt.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the filing.</p>
</text>
